{"id":"entonces","lemma":"entonces","pos":"adv","rank":67,"glosses":["then, next, thereupon, at that time, at that point","then, therefore, so, thus; in that case"],"ipa":"/enˈtonθes/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-entonces.wav","examples":[{"text":"Yo era feliz entonces.","en":"I was happy then.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442639","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"happy, merry"},null]},{"text":"¿Entonces dónde estabas?","en":"So where were you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/35310","words":[null,{"g":"where"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"}]},{"text":"¿Entonces qué pasó?","en":"Then what happened?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501354","words":[null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,3,"what's happening?"]]},{"text":"¿Entonces ahora qué hago?","en":"So what do I do now?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/731895","words":[null,{"g":"now"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"}]},{"text":"Nosotros éramos más jóvenes entonces.","en":"We were younger then.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453568","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"young, youthful","l":"joven"},null]}]}